  <Title type="string">Towards negative space and its landlord (TLA access Protected)</Title>
  <synopsis type="string">The artist talks about a sculpture made entirely of hesitation. A curator joined for ten minutes and left convinced that the chair was part of the exhibition.</synopsis>
